    /// <summary>🎵 BGM 무드 → 프리셋 트랙(내 BGM 업로드 시 유지 · 해석 실패 → 현행 유지). 반환: 토스트 접미.</summary>
    private async Task<string> ApplyBgmMoodAsync(string? mood)
    {
        if (_customBgm is not null) return " · 🎵 내 BGM 유지";
        if (string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(mood) || EcoSp.GetService(typeof(PromptFlowStudio.Services.Pluto.IPlutoAdaptivePatternRanker)) is not PromptFlowStudio.Services.Pluto.IPlutoAdaptivePatternRanker ranker) return "";
        var id = ranker.ResolveRecommendedBgmTrackId(mood, BabyBgmTrackIds, _bgmTrack.ToString());
        if (!Enum.TryParse<PromptFlowStudio.Services.Export.BabyBgmTrack>(id, true, out var track) || !Enum.IsDefined(track)) return "";
        if (track == _bgmTrack && _bgmOn) return "";
        _bgmTrack = track;
        _bgmOn = true;
        await SyncBgmPreviewAsync();
        return " · 🎵 BGM " + PromptFlowStudio.Services.Export.StockSuiteExporter.BabyBgmLabel(track);
    }

    // ── ⚡ Step 5 — A/B 변형 영상 결선 · 연속 렌더 · 미리보기 · 짝 내보내기 ──
    private bool _abDualBusy, _abExportBusy;
    private string? _abRenderProgress;
    private string? _abArtId, _abArtA, _abArtB;   // 실재 확인된 결선 영상 캐시(실험 ID 키)

    /// <summary>⚖️ 변형별 몽타주 출력 경로 — <c>{첫 사진}_{실험ID}_{A|B}[_9x16]_montage.mp4</c>(A/B 덮어쓰기 방지 · 실패 → null = 기본 경로).</summary>
    private static string? AbVariantOutputPath(string experimentId, string firstPhoto, bool challenger, bool vertical9x16, string? outputDirectory)
    {
        try
        {
            var dir = string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(outputDirectory)
                ? Path.Combine(Path.GetTempPath(), "PromptFlowStudio", PromptFlowStudio.Services.Export.StockSuiteExporter.MotionOutputFolder) : outputDirectory;
            var id = experimentId.Trim();
            var invalid = Path.GetInvalidFileNameChars();
            var sb = new System.Text.StringBuilder(id.Length);
            foreach (var ch in id) sb.Append(Array.IndexOf(invalid, ch) >= 0 ? '_' : ch);
            return Path.Combine(dir, Path.GetFileNameWithoutExtension(firstPhoto) + "_" + sb.ToString() + (challenger ? "_B" : "_A") + (vertical9x16 ? "_9x16" : "")
                + PromptFlowStudio.Services.Export.StockSuiteExporter.MontageFileSuffix);
        }
        catch (Exception ex) when (ex is ArgumentException or PathTooLongException or NotSupportedException) { Program.Log("Workspace.AbOutputPath", ex); return null; }
    }

    /// <summary>🎞️ 렌더 영상 → 장부 변형 슬롯 결선(예외 격리 · 미리보기 캐시 무효화).</summary>
    private void AttachAbArtifact(string experimentId, string? championPath, string? challengerPath)
    {
        try
        {
            if (EcoSp.GetService(typeof(PromptFlowStudio.Services.Pluto.IPlutoExperimentLedgerService)) is PromptFlowStudio.Services.Pluto.IPlutoExperimentLedgerService ledger)
            {
                ledger.AttachVariantArtifacts(experimentId, championPath, challengerPath);
                var tags = ActiveViralTagsSafe(3);   // 🏷️ Step 20 — 카탈로그 기록과 같은 렌더 시점 태그를 장부에도 영구 기록(100건 롤오프 무관)
                ledger.AttachVariantStyleTags(experimentId, championPath is null ? null : tags, challengerPath is null ? null : tags);
            }
        }
        catch (Exception ex) { Program.Log("Workspace.AbAttach", ex); }   // [부분 구제] 렌더 결과는 보존
        _abArtId = null;
    }

    /// <summary>🎞️ 실험의 디스크 실재 결선 영상(실험 ID 캐시 · 서비스 부재/예외 → 없음).</summary>
    private (string? A, string? B) AbArtifactsFor(string experimentId)
    {
        if (string.Equals(_abArtId, experimentId, StringComparison.Ordinal)) return (_abArtA, _abArtB);
        string? a = null, b = null;
        try
        {
            if ((EcoSp.GetService(typeof(PromptFlowStudio.Services.Pluto.IPlutoExperimentLedgerService)) as PromptFlowStudio.Services.Pluto.IPlutoExperimentLedgerService)?.GetExperimentArtifacts(experimentId) is { } snap)
            {
                if (snap.ChampionVideoPath is { } pa && File.Exists(pa)) a = pa;
                if (snap.ChallengerVideoPath is { } pb && File.Exists(pb)) b = pb;
            }
        }
        catch (Exception ex) { Program.Log("Workspace.AbArtifacts", ex); }
        _abArtId = experimentId;
        _abArtA = a;
        _abArtB = b;
        return (a, b);
    }

    /// <summary>⚡ [A/B 두 변형 연속 렌더링] — 챔피언 A(훅 · 룩 · BGM · 자막) → 챌린저 B 순차 렌더 → 두 영상 장부 결선([부분 구제] 한쪽 실패 시 다른 쪽 보존).</summary>
    private async Task RenderAbBothVariantsAsync()
    {
        if (_abPlan is not { } ab || _abDualBusy || _abExportBusy || _montageBusy || _motionBusy || _stockBusy || _montagePhotos.Count < 2) return;
        if (!ReferenceEquals(_abPlanSource, _activeMontagePlan)) { _abToast = "⚠ 몽타주 구성이 바뀌었습니다 — A/B 변형을 다시 생성하세요."; return; }
        _abDualBusy = true;
        _abToast = null;
        string? outA = null, outB = null;
        var aborted = false;
        try
        {
            for (var i = 0; i < 2 && !aborted; i++)
            {
                var challenger = i == 1;
                _abRenderProgress = challenger ? "A/B 실험 연속 렌더링 중 (2/2 Challenger B)..." : "A/B 실험 연속 렌더링 중 (1/2 Champion A)...";
                await InvokeAsync(StateHasChanged);
                await ApplyAbVariantAsync(challenger);
                if (_disposed) return;
                if (!ReferenceEquals(ab, _abPlan) || !ReferenceEquals(_abPlanSource, _activeMontagePlan) || _abActiveB != challenger) { aborted = true; break; }   // 플랜 교체 → 중단
                await RenderMontageCoreAsync(false);
                if (_disposed) return;
                if (_mediaCts.IsCancellationRequested) return;   // 페이지 이탈
                var o = _montageOutput is { } mo && File.Exists(mo) ? mo : null;
                if (challenger) outB = o; else outA = o;
            }
            if (outA is not null || outB is not null) AttachAbArtifact(ab.ExperimentId, outA, outB);
            _abToast = aborted ? "⚠ 몽타주 구성이 바뀌어 A/B 연속 렌더링을 중단했습니다 — 변형을 다시 생성하세요."
                : outA is not null && outB is not null ? "✅ ⚡ A/B 두 변형 렌더 완료 · 🏆 " + Path.GetFileName(outA) + " · 🧪 " + Path.GetFileName(outB) + " — 실험 장부에 결선"
                : outA is null && outB is null ? "⚠ A/B 두 변형 렌더 모두 실패 — " + (_montageToast ?? "")
                : "⚠ [부분 구제] " + (outA is null ? "챔피언 A" : "챌린저 B") + " 렌더 실패 · 성공한 변형만 장부에 결선";
        }
        catch (OperationCanceledException) { return; }   // 페이지 이탈
        catch (Exception ex) { Program.Log("Workspace.AbDualRender", ex); _abToast = "⚠ A/B 연속 렌더링 실패: " + PromptFlowStudio.Services.Pluto.PlutoAutonomousActivityFeedService.Redact(ex.Message); }
        finally { _abDualBusy = false; _abRenderProgress = null; }
        if (_disposed) return;
        await InvokeAsync(StateHasChanged);
    }

    /// <summary>▶ 변형 영상 → 라이브 캔버스 로드(디스크 실재 재확인 · 예외 격리).</summary>
    private void PreviewAbVariant(string? path, bool challenger)
    {
        if (string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(path) || !File.Exists(path)) { _abEvalToast = "⚠ " + (challenger ? "B" : "A") + "안 영상을 찾을 수 없습니다 — 다시 렌더하세요."; _abArtId = null; return; }
        try
        {
            _canvasQueueUrl = Media.ToPlaybackUrl(path);
            _canvasQueuePath = path;
            _abEvalToast = "▶ " + (challenger ? "🧪 B안" : "🏆 A안") + " 미리보기 · " + Path.GetFileName(path);
        }
        catch (Exception ex) { Program.Log("Workspace.AbPreview", ex); _abEvalToast = "⚠ 미리보기 로드 실패: " + PromptFlowStudio.Services.Pluto.PlutoAutonomousActivityFeedService.Redact(ex.Message); }
    }

    /// <summary>📦 [A/B 실험 폴더 동시 내보내기] — 결선된 A/B 영상 → <c>{테마}_AB_{yyyyMMdd}\VariantA|VariantB</c> + 실험 매니페스트(예외 전파 금지).</summary>
    private async Task ExportAbExperimentAsync()
    {
        if (_abPlan is not { } ab || _abExportBusy || _abDualBusy || _montageBusy) return;
        var root = StockSuite.ConfiguredDirectory;
        if (string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(root)) { _abToast = "⚠ StockSuite 에셋 경로가 설정되지 않았습니다 — 환경설정에서 경로를 지정하세요."; return; }
        _abArtId = null;
        var (a, b) = AbArtifactsFor(ab.ExperimentId);
        if (a is null && b is null) { _abToast = "⚠ 결선된 A/B 영상이 없습니다 — [⚡ A/B 두 변형 연속 렌더링] 후 다시 시도하세요."; return; }
        _abExportBusy = true;
        StateHasChanged();
        try
        {
            var r = await StockSuite.ExportABExperimentToStockSuiteAsync(root, ab, a, b, _mediaCts.Token);
            _abToast = (r.Ok ? "✅ " : "⚠ ") + r.Message;
        }
        catch (OperationCanceledException) { return; }   // 페이지 이탈
        catch (Exception ex) { Program.Log("Workspace.AbExport", ex); _abToast = "⚠ A/B 실험 내보내기 실패: " + PromptFlowStudio.Services.Pluto.PlutoAutonomousActivityFeedService.Redact(ex.Message); }
        finally { _abExportBusy = false; }
        if (_disposed) return;
        await InvokeAsync(StateHasChanged);
    }

    // ── 🏆 Pluto 4.4 — A/B 실험 승자 판정 & 차등 학습 ──
    private sealed class AbMetricsForm { public double Hook { get; set; } public double Completion { get; set; } public double Ctr { get; set; } }
    private readonly AbMetricsForm _abEvalA = new(), _abEvalB = new();
    private bool _abEvalOpen, _abEvalBusy;
    private PromptFlowStudio.Services.Pluto.PlutoExperimentEvaluationResult? _abEvalResult;
    private string? _abEvalToast;

    private static string AbWinnerBadge(string winner)
        => winner == PromptFlowStudio.Services.Pluto.PlutoExperimentLedgerService.WinnerTie ? "🤝 무승부"
            : winner == PromptFlowStudio.Services.Pluto.PlutoExperimentLedgerService.WinnerChallenger ? "👑 챌린저 B 승리" : "👑 챔피언 A 방어";

    /// <summary>🏆 [판정 &amp; 학습 저장] — 합성 점수 승자 · 상승률 · 차등 강화 · 장부 원자 기록(예외 전파 금지).</summary>
    private async Task EvaluateAbExperimentAsync()
    {
        if (_abEvalBusy || AbEvalTarget is not { } ab) return;
        if (EcoSp.GetService(typeof(PromptFlowStudio.Services.Pluto.IPlutoExperimentLedgerService)) is not PromptFlowStudio.Services.Pluto.IPlutoExperimentLedgerService ledger) { _abEvalToast = "⚠ 실험 장부를 사용할 수 없습니다."; return; }
        _abEvalBusy = true;
        _abEvalToast = null;
        StateHasChanged();
        try
        {
            var a = new PromptFlowStudio.Services.Pluto.PlutoExperimentMetricsInput(_abEvalA.Hook, _abEvalA.Completion, _abEvalA.Ctr);
            var b = new PromptFlowStudio.Services.Pluto.PlutoExperimentMetricsInput(_abEvalB.Hook, _abEvalB.Completion, _abEvalB.Ctr);
            var result = await ledger.EvaluateExperimentAsync(ab, a, b, _mediaCts.Token);
            if (_disposed) return;
            _abEvalResult = result;
            if (!result.AlreadyRegistered) await RefreshAdaptiveRecommendationAsync();   // 🧠 차등 강화 → 학습 추천 갱신
            await RefreshAbPendingAsync();   // 📋 Pending → Evaluated 전이 반영
            await RefreshBrainSummaryAsync();   // 🧠 두뇌 리포트 갱신
        }
        catch (OperationCanceledException) { return; }   // 페이지 이탈
        catch (Exception ex) { Program.Log("Workspace.AbEvaluate", ex); _abEvalToast = "⚠ 승자 판정 실패: " + PromptFlowStudio.Services.Pluto.PlutoAutonomousActivityFeedService.Redact(ex.Message); }
        finally { _abEvalBusy = false; }
        if (_disposed) return;
        await InvokeAsync(StateHasChanged);
    }

    // ── 📋 Pluto 4.5 — 영속 대기 A/B 실험 큐 ──
    private IReadOnlyList<PromptFlowStudio.Services.Pluto.PlutoVariantABPlan> _abPending = Array.Empty<PromptFlowStudio.Services.Pluto.PlutoVariantABPlan>();
    private PromptFlowStudio.Services.Pluto.PlutoVariantABPlan? _abPendingPick;
    private bool _abPendingOpen;

    /// <summary>판정 대상 — 대기 목록에서 고른 실험 우선 · 없으면 현재 생성 실험.</summary>
    private PromptFlowStudio.Services.Pluto.PlutoVariantABPlan? AbEvalTarget => _abPendingPick ?? _abPlan;

    /// <summary>📋 장부 선적재 → 대기 실험 목록 갱신(예외 전파 금지 · 판정 완료된 선택은 결과 표시 후 해제).</summary>
    private async Task RefreshAbPendingAsync()
    {
        if (_disposed || EcoSp.GetService(typeof(PromptFlowStudio.Services.Pluto.IPlutoExperimentLedgerService)) is not PromptFlowStudio.Services.Pluto.IPlutoExperimentLedgerService ledger) return;
        try
        {
            await ledger.EnsureLoadedAsync(_mediaCts.Token);
            var list = ledger.GetPendingExperiments(20);
            if (_disposed) return;
            _abPending = list;
            if (_abPendingPick is { } pick)
            {
                var still = false;
                for (var i = 0; i < list.Count; i++) if (string.Equals(list[i].ExperimentId, pick.ExperimentId, StringComparison.Ordinal)) { still = true; break; }
                if (!still && !(_abEvalResult is { } r && string.Equals(r.ExperimentId, pick.ExperimentId, StringComparison.Ordinal))) _abPendingPick = null;
            }
        }
        catch (OperationCanceledException) { return; }   // 페이지 이탈
        catch (Exception ex) { Program.Log("Workspace.AbPending", ex); return; }
        if (_disposed) return;
        await InvokeAsync(StateHasChanged);
    }

    /// <summary>📋 [대기 중인 A/B 실험 선택] 토글 — 열 때 장부 재조회.</summary>
    private async Task ToggleAbPendingAsync()
    {
        _abPendingOpen = !_abPendingOpen;
        if (_abPendingOpen) await RefreshAbPendingAsync();
    }

    private void OnAbPendingPicked(ChangeEventArgs e)
    {
        var id = e.Value as string;
        _abPendingPick = null;
        if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(id))
            foreach (var p in _abPending)
                if (string.Equals(p.ExperimentId, id, StringComparison.Ordinal)) { _abPendingPick = p; break; }
        _abEvalToast = _abPendingPick is { } pk ? "📋 실험 " + pk.ExperimentId + " 불러옴 · A '" + pk.ChampionA.HookStyle + "' vs B '" + pk.ChallengerB.HookStyle + "'" : null;
    }

    /// <summary>🏆 판정 입력 폼(현재 실험 패널 · 대기 실험 카드 공용).</summary>
    private RenderFragment AbEvalForm(PromptFlowStudio.Services.Pluto.PlutoVariantABPlan? current) => __builder =>
    {
        var target = _abPendingPick ?? current;
        <div class="ws-retry" data-ab-eval-panel="@(target?.ExperimentId ?? "")" style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;align-items:center;width:100%">
            <button class="ws-back" data-ab-pending-toggle="1" @onclick="ToggleAbPendingAsync" aria-expanded="@(_abPendingOpen ? "true" : "false")" title="이전에 등록한 판정 대기(Pending) 실험을 불러와 오늘의 성과로 채점 — 앱 재시작 후에도 장부에 보존">[📋 대기 중인 A/B 실험 선택] (@(_abPending.Count.ToString(CultureInfo.InvariantCulture)))</button>
            @if (_abPendingOpen)
            {
                <select data-ab-pending-select="1" @onchange="OnAbPendingPicked">
                    <option value="" selected="@(_abPendingPick is null)">@(current is null ? "— 실험을 선택하세요 —" : "— 현재 실험 (" + current.ExperimentId + ") —")</option>
                    @foreach (var pp in _abPending)
                    {
                        <option value="@(pp.ExperimentId)" selected="@(_abPendingPick is not null && string.Equals(_abPendingPick.ExperimentId, pp.ExperimentId, StringComparison.Ordinal))">@(pp.ExperimentId) · '@(pp.ChampionA.HookStyle)' vs '@(pp.ChallengerB.HookStyle)'@(string.IsNullOrEmpty(pp.ThemeHint) ? "" : " · " + pp.ThemeHint)</option>
                    }
                </select>
            }
            @if (target is null) { <span class="ws-retry" data-ab-eval-empty="1">판정할 실험을 선택하세요.</span> }
            else
            {
                <span class="ws-pcore on" data-ab-eval-target="@(target.ExperimentId)">⚖️ @(target.ExperimentId)</span>
                var (artA, artB) = AbArtifactsFor(target.ExperimentId);
                @if (artA is not null) { <button class="ws-back" data-ab-preview="A" @onclick="() => PreviewAbVariant(artA, false)" title="@(artA)">[▶ A안 미리보기]</button> }
                @if (artB is not null) { <button class="ws-back" data-ab-preview="B" @onclick="() => PreviewAbVariant(artB, true)" title="@(artB)">[▶ B안 미리보기]</button> }
                <span>🏆 A</span>
                <label>3초 % <input type="number" step="0.1" min="0" max="100" style="width:64px" data-ab-eval-a-hook="1" @bind="_abEvalA.Hook" /></label>
                <label>완주 % <input type="number" step="0.1" min="0" max="100" style="width:64px" data-ab-eval-a-comp="1" @bind="_abEvalA.Completion" /></label>
                <label>CTR % <input type="number" step="0.1" min="0" max="100" style="width:64px" data-ab-eval-a-ctr="1" @bind="_abEvalA.Ctr" /></label>
                <span>🧪 B</span>
                <label>3초 % <input type="number" step="0.1" min="0" max="100" style="width:64px" data-ab-eval-b-hook="1" @bind="_abEvalB.Hook" /></label>
                <label>완주 % <input type="number" step="0.1" min="0" max="100" style="width:64px" data-ab-eval-b-comp="1" @bind="_abEvalB.Completion" /></label>
                <label>CTR % <input type="number" step="0.1" min="0" max="100" style="width:64px" data-ab-eval-b-ctr="1" @bind="_abEvalB.Ctr" /></label>
                <button class="ws-back" data-ab-eval-run="1" @onclick="EvaluateAbExperimentAsync" disabled="@(_abEvalBusy)">[판정 &amp; 학습 저장]</button>
                @if (_abEvalBusy) { <span class="ws-retry" role="status" data-ab-eval-busy="1"><span class="ws-motion-spin" aria-hidden="true"></span> 🏆 판정 중…</span> }
                else if (_abEvalResult is { } aer && string.Equals(aer.ExperimentId, target.ExperimentId, StringComparison.Ordinal))
                {
                    <span class="ws-pcore on" data-ab-eval-winner="@(aer.WinnerLabel)">@(AbWinnerBadge(aer.WinnerLabel)) · A @(aer.ChampionScore.ToString("0.0", CultureInfo.InvariantCulture)) vs B @(aer.ChallengerScore.ToString("0.0", CultureInfo.InvariantCulture)) · 상승 +@(aer.LiftPct.ToString("0.#", CultureInfo.InvariantCulture))% · +@(aer.TotalXpAwarded.ToString(CultureInfo.InvariantCulture)) XP@(aer.AlreadyRegistered ? " · ⏭ 기존 판정" : "")</span>
                    <span class="ws-retry" data-ab-eval-summary="1">@(aer.SummaryMessage)</span>
                }
            }
            @if (_abEvalToast is { } aet) { <span class="ws-retry" role="status" data-ab-eval-toast="1">@(aet)</span> }
        </div>
    };

    // ── 📚 Pluto 4.4 — 시리즈 자동 분할 ──
    private PromptFlowStudio.Services.Pluto.PlutoSeriesBatchResult? _series;
    private bool _seriesBusy;
    private string? _seriesToast;
    private int _seriesActiveEpisode;
    private string? _seriesEpisodeKey;   // 불러온 편의 사진 목록 — 일치 시 3막 자막에 "n/N편" 장식
    private PromptFlowStudio.Services.Pluto.PlutoSeriesContinuityDirective? _seriesDirective;   // 📺 불러온 편의 연속성 지시(앵커 · 훅 에스컬레이션)
    private string? _seriesAnchorLookPinned;   // 📺 시리즈 앵커로 고정한 룩(학습 최적 룩 고정과 구분해 해제)
    private PromptFlowStudio.Services.Pluto.PlutoSeriesSeasonInfo? _seriesSeason;   // 🆕 현재 시즌(아크 기록이 있으면 [새 시즌 분리] 노출)
    private bool _seriesAutoRewrite = true;   // 📺 이탈 에스컬레이션 적용 방식 — 자동 각색(기본) ↔ 추천만 표시
    private PromptFlowStudio.Services.Pluto.PlutoSubtitleOverlayState? _seriesCueState;   // 💬 시리즈 편 자막 원문(생성 + 수동 편집) · 덧입힘과 분리
    private IReadOnlyList<PromptFlowStudio.Services.Export.SubtitleCue>? _seriesComposedCues;   // 마지막 합성 결과(이미 합성된 자막인지 판정)
    private bool _cueEditorOpen;

    private PromptFlowStudio.Services.Pluto.PlutoSeriesEscalationMode SeriesEscalationMode => _seriesAutoRewrite ? PromptFlowStudio.Services.Pluto.PlutoSeriesEscalationMode.AutoRewrite : PromptFlowStudio.Services.Pluto.PlutoSeriesEscalationMode.RecommendOnly;

    /// <summary>불러온 편에 걸린 연속성 지시(다른 편 지시 → null).</summary>
    private PromptFlowStudio.Services.Pluto.PlutoSeriesContinuityDirective? ActiveSeriesDirective()
        => _seriesDirective is { } d && d.NextEpisodeNumber == _seriesActiveEpisode ? d : null;

    /// <summary>💬 원문 → (자동 각색일 때만) 덧입힘 → “n/N편” 장식으로 표시 자막 재합성(재생성 없음 · 수동 편집 보존).</summary>
    private void RecomposeSeriesCues()
    {
        if (_series is not { } s || _seriesCueState is not { } st || _seriesActiveEpisode <= 0) return;
        _montageCues = PromptFlowStudio.Services.Pluto.PlutoSeriesSubtitleOverlay.Compose(st, ActiveSeriesDirective(), SeriesEscalationMode, _seriesActiveEpisode, s.Episodes.Count);
        _seriesComposedCues = _montageCues;
    }

    private void ToggleCueEditor() => _cueEditorOpen = !_cueEditorOpen;

    /// <summary>✏️ 자막 1줄 수동 편집 — 시리즈 편은 원문에 반영 후 재합성 · 진행 중 AI 생성 결과가 편집을 덮지 않게 세대 무효화(예외 전파 금지).</summary>
    private void EditMontageCue(int index, string? text)
    {
        try
        {
            if (_montageCues is not { Count: > 0 } cues || index < 0 || index >= cues.Count) return;
            _montageStorySeq++;   // 진행 중 3막 생성 결과 폐기 — 수동 편집이 이긴다
            _montageStoryBusy = false;
            if (_series is { } s && _seriesCueState is { } st && ReferenceEquals(cues, _seriesComposedCues))
            {
                _seriesCueState = PromptFlowStudio.Services.Pluto.PlutoSeriesSubtitleOverlay.ApplyEdit(st, ActiveSeriesDirective(), SeriesEscalationMode, _seriesActiveEpisode, s.Episodes.Count, index, text);
                RecomposeSeriesCues();
            }
            else _montageCues = PromptFlowStudio.Services.Pluto.PlutoSeriesSubtitleOverlay.EditPlain(cues, index, text);
            _cuesManualEditRef = _montageCues;   // 🎯 기획 1클릭 적용이 직접 고친 자막을 재생성하지 않도록 표식
        }
        catch (Exception ex) { Program.Log("Workspace.CueEdit", ex); }
    }

    private PromptFlowStudio.Services.Pluto.IPlutoSeriesArcMemoryService? SeriesArcMemory()
        => EcoSp.GetService(typeof(PromptFlowStudio.Services.Pluto.IPlutoSeriesArcMemoryService)) as PromptFlowStudio.Services.Pluto.IPlutoSeriesArcMemoryService;

    /// <summary>🆕 시즌 현황 · 적용 방식 재조회(메모리 기준 · 예외 전파 금지).</summary>
    private void RefreshSeriesSeasonInfo()
    {
        try
        {
            if (_series is { } s && SeriesArcMemory() is { } arc)
            {
                _seriesSeason = arc.GetSeasonInfo(s.SeriesTheme, s.Episodes.Count);
                _seriesAutoRewrite = arc.EscalationMode == PromptFlowStudio.Services.Pluto.PlutoSeriesEscalationMode.AutoRewrite;
            }
            else _seriesSeason = null;
        }
        catch (Exception ex) { Program.Log("Workspace.SeriesSeason", ex); _seriesSeason = null; }
    }

    /// <summary>🆕 [새 시즌 분리] — 현재 시즌 기록은 보존하고 같은 테마의 새 아크를 연다 → 불러온 편을 새 시즌 기준으로 다시 조립(예외 전파 금지).</summary>
    private async Task StartNewSeriesSeasonAsync()
    {
        if (_series is not { } s || _seriesBusy || _montageBusy || _seriesRenderAllBusy || SeriesArcMemory() is not { } arc) return;
        var before = _seriesSeason?.Season ?? 1;
        PromptFlowStudio.Services.Pluto.PlutoSeriesSeasonInfo info;
        try { info = await arc.StartNewSeasonAsync(s.SeriesTheme, s.Episodes.Count, _mediaCts.Token); }
        catch (OperationCanceledException) { return; }   // 페이지 이탈
        catch (Exception ex) { Program.Log("Workspace.SeriesNewSeason", ex); _seriesToast = "⚠ 새 시즌 분리 실패: " + PromptFlowStudio.Services.Pluto.PlutoAutonomousActivityFeedService.Redact(ex.Message); await InvokeAsync(StateHasChanged); return; }
        if (_disposed || !ReferenceEquals(_series, s)) return;
        _seriesSeason = info;
        if (info.Season <= before)
        {
            _seriesToast = "ℹ️ 현재 시즌에 기록된 편이 없어 분리하지 않았어요";
            await InvokeAsync(StateHasChanged);
            return;
        }
        var label = "🆕 시즌 " + info.Season.ToString(CultureInfo.InvariantCulture) + " 시작 — 이전 시즌 기록은 보존";
        PromptFlowStudio.Services.Pluto.PlutoSeriesEpisodePlan? active = null;
        foreach (var ep in s.Episodes) if (ep.EpisodeNumber == _seriesActiveEpisode) { active = ep; break; }
        if (active is not null && !_montageBusy && !_curationBusy)
        {
            // 새 아크 기준 지시(대개 None) — 이전 시즌의 앵커 · 덧입힘만 걷어내고 자막 원문(수동 편집 포함)은 그대로 다시 합성
            var directive = await ResolveSeriesContinuityAsync(active);
            if (_disposed || !ReferenceEquals(_series, s) || _seriesActiveEpisode != active.EpisodeNumber) return;
            var lookBefore = _montageLook;
            var bgmChanged = ApplySeriesContinuityAnchors(directive);
            RefreshSeriesSeasonInfo();
            if (bgmChanged && _bgmOn) await SyncBgmPreviewAsync();
            RefreshMontageLook();
            if (bgmChanged || !string.Equals(lookBefore, _montageLook, StringComparison.Ordinal))
                await RefreshMontagePreviewKeepingCuesAsync();   // 비트 · 색 프리뷰는 다시 · 자막 문구는 새 컷 경계로만 이동
            else RecomposeSeriesCues();
            if (_disposed) return;
            _seriesToast = label + (directive.HasGuidance ? " · 📺 " + directive.ReasonKorean : "") + (_seriesCueState is { HasManualEdits: true } ? " · ✏️ 수동 편집 유지" : "");
        }
        else _seriesToast = label;
        await InvokeAsync(StateHasChanged);
    }

    /// <summary>🎞 프리뷰 재구성(비트 · 색 변경 반영) — 재생성된 템플릿 자막 대신 기존 원문 문구를 새 컷 경계로 옮겨 유지(큐 수가 다르면 새 결과 채택).</summary>
    private async Task RefreshMontagePreviewKeepingCuesAsync()
    {
        var keep = _seriesCueState;
        await RefreshMontagePreviewAsync();
        if (_disposed || keep is null || _montageCues is not { Count: > 0 } fresh) return;
        if (PromptFlowStudio.Services.Pluto.PlutoSeriesSubtitleOverlay.RetimeOnto(keep, fresh) is { } moved)
        {
            _seriesCueState = moved;
            RecomposeSeriesCues();
        }
    }

    /// <summary>📺 [자동 각색 적용 ↔ 추천만 표시] 전환(영속) — 자막 원문은 그대로 두고 덧입힘만 켜고 끈다(예외 전파 금지).</summary>
    private async Task ToggleSeriesEscalationModeAsync()
    {
        if (_seriesBusy || _montageBusy || _seriesRenderAllBusy) return;
        _seriesAutoRewrite = !_seriesAutoRewrite;
        try
        {
            if (SeriesArcMemory() is { } arc)
                await arc.SetEscalationModeAsync(_seriesAutoRewrite ? PromptFlowStudio.Services.Pluto.PlutoSeriesEscalationMode.AutoRewrite : PromptFlowStudio.Services.Pluto.PlutoSeriesEscalationMode.RecommendOnly, _mediaCts.Token);
        }
        catch (OperationCanceledException) { return; }   // 페이지 이탈
        catch (Exception ex) { Program.Log("Workspace.SeriesEscalationMode", ex); }   // [부분 구제] 이번 세션에는 적용
        if (_disposed) return;
        RecomposeSeriesCues();   // ✏️ 추천만 → 원문(수동 편집) 그대로 · 자동 각색 → 현재 원문 위에 덧입힘 — 재생성 없음
        await InvokeAsync(StateHasChanged);
    }

    /// <summary>📚 [시리즈 자동 분할] — 후보 풀 → 서로소 2~3편 → 1편 즉시 불러오기(예외 전파 금지).</summary>
    private async Task BuildSeriesAsync()
    {
        if (_seriesBusy || _curationBusy || _montageBusy) return;
        if (EcoSp.GetService(typeof(PromptFlowStudio.Services.Pluto.IPlutoSeriesBatchPlanner)) is not PromptFlowStudio.Services.Pluto.IPlutoSeriesBatchPlanner planner) { _seriesToast = "⚠ 시리즈 분할기를 사용할 수 없습니다."; return; }
        _seriesBusy = true;
        _seriesToast = null;
        StateHasChanged();
        try
        {
            var prompt = _prompt ?? "";
            var theme = prompt.Length > 40 ? prompt[..40] : prompt;
            var result = await planner.BuildSeriesAsync(_curationPool.ToArray(), theme, _plannedSeriesEpisodes >= 2 ? _plannedSeriesEpisodes : 3, _mediaCts.Token);   // 🎯 기획안 편수(없음 → 3편)
            if (_disposed) return;
            _series = result;
            _seriesEpisodeOutputs.Clear();
            _seriesActiveEpisode = 0;
            _seriesEpisodeKey = null;
            _seriesDirective = null;
            _seriesSeason = null;
        }
        catch (OperationCanceledException) { return; }   // 페이지 이탈
        catch (InvalidOperationException ex) { _series = null; _seriesToast = "⚠ " + PromptFlowStudio.Services.Pluto.PlutoAutonomousActivityFeedService.Redact(ex.Message); }
        catch (Exception ex) { Program.Log("Workspace.SeriesBuild", ex); _series = null; _seriesToast = "⚠ 시리즈 분할 실패: " + PromptFlowStudio.Services.Pluto.PlutoAutonomousActivityFeedService.Redact(ex.Message); }
        finally { _seriesBusy = false; }
        if (_disposed) return;
        if (_series is { Episodes.Count: > 0 } s) await LoadSeriesEpisodeAsync(s.Episodes[0]);
        else await InvokeAsync(StateHasChanged);
    }

    /// <summary>▶ 편 불러오기 — 컷 · 초점 → 몽타주 큐 → 프리뷰 재구성(3막 자막 "n/N편" 장식 · 편별 SNS 키트).</summary>
    private async Task LoadSeriesEpisodeAsync(PromptFlowStudio.Services.Pluto.PlutoSeriesEpisodePlan ep)
    {
        if (ep is null || _montageBusy || _curationBusy) return;
        var photos = new string[ep.Cuts.Count];
        var focals = new (double X, double Y)[photos.Length];
        for (var i = 0; i < photos.Length; i++) { photos[i] = ep.Cuts[i].ImagePath; focals[i] = ep.Cuts[i].FocalPoint; }
        _montagePhotos.Clear();
        _montagePhotos.AddRange(photos);
        _stagedFocalPoints = focals;
        _stagedFocalKey = string.Join("|", photos);
        _seriesEpisodeKey = _stagedFocalKey;
        _seriesActiveEpisode = ep.EpisodeNumber;
        _seriesCueState = null;   // 다른 편 — 새 원문에서 출발
        _seriesComposedCues = null;
        _curationResult = null;   // 시리즈 편 컷 ≠ 단편 큐레이션 선택
        _showCurationDetails = false;
        _montageOutput = null;
        _abPlan = null;
        _abPlanSource = null;
        _snsKit = ep.PublishingKit;
        _seriesToast = "📚 " + ep.EpisodeTitle + " 불러옴 · " + ep.Cuts.Count.ToString(CultureInfo.InvariantCulture) + "컷";
        // 📺 앞선 편의 앵커 룩/BGM 유지 + 편 간 이탈 시 훅 에스컬레이션(1편 · 미추적 시리즈 → 무동작)
        var directive = await ResolveSeriesContinuityAsync(ep);
        if (_disposed || _seriesActiveEpisode != ep.EpisodeNumber || !string.Equals(_seriesEpisodeKey, _stagedFocalKey, StringComparison.Ordinal)) return;
        var anchorBgmChanged = ApplySeriesContinuityAnchors(directive);
        RefreshSeriesSeasonInfo();
        if (directive.HasGuidance) _seriesToast += " · 📺 " + directive.ReasonKorean;
        if (anchorBgmChanged && _bgmOn) await SyncBgmPreviewAsync();
        RefreshMontageLook();
        StateHasChanged();
        await RefreshMontagePreviewAsync();
        if (_disposed) return;
        await InvokeAsync(StateHasChanged);
    }

    /// <summary>📺 다음 편 연속성 지시 조회(예외 전파 금지 · 서비스 미등록/1편 → None).</summary>
    private async Task<PromptFlowStudio.Services.Pluto.PlutoSeriesContinuityDirective> ResolveSeriesContinuityAsync(PromptFlowStudio.Services.Pluto.PlutoSeriesEpisodePlan ep)
    {
        var none = PromptFlowStudio.Services.Pluto.PlutoSeriesContinuityDirective.None;
        if (_series is not { } s) return none;
        if (EcoSp.GetService(typeof(PromptFlowStudio.Services.Pluto.IPlutoSeriesArcMemoryService)) is not PromptFlowStudio.Services.Pluto.IPlutoSeriesArcMemoryService arc) return none;
        try
        {
            // 1편은 이어받을 지시가 없지만 아크는 미리 적재한다 — 시즌 · 적용 방식 표시 + 렌더 write-through 가 디스크 상태 위에 바로 얹히게
            if (ep.EpisodeNumber <= 1) { await arc.EnsureLoadedAsync(_mediaCts.Token); return none; }
            return await arc.GetContinuityDirectiveAsync(s.SeriesTheme, s.Episodes.Count, ep.EpisodeNumber, _mediaCts.Token);
        }
        catch (OperationCanceledException) { return none; }   // 페이지 이탈
        catch (Exception ex) { Program.Log("Workspace.SeriesContinuity", ex); return none; }
    }

    /// <summary>📺 앵커 룩 고정 · 앵커 BGM 트랙 선택(내 BGM 업로드 · 사용자가 직접 고른 트랙은 보존) — 반환 = BGM 변경 여부.</summary>
    private bool ApplySeriesContinuityAnchors(PromptFlowStudio.Services.Pluto.PlutoSeriesContinuityDirective directive)
    {
        _seriesDirective = directive.HasGuidance ? directive : null;
        // 이전 편/시리즈에서 건 앵커 고정은 이번 지시로 교체(학습 최적 룩 고정은 건드리지 않음)
        if (_seriesAnchorLookPinned is { } prev && string.Equals(_learnedLookPinned, prev, StringComparison.Ordinal)) _learnedLookPinned = null;
        _seriesAnchorLookPinned = null;
        if (directive.AnchorColorLookId.Length > 0 && _learnedLookPinned is null
            && PromptFlowStudio.Services.Pluto.PlutoColorGradingCompiler.TryGetPreset(directive.AnchorColorLookId) is not null)
        {
            _learnedLookPinned = directive.AnchorColorLookId;
            _seriesAnchorLookPinned = directive.AnchorColorLookId;
        }
        if (_customBgm is not null || _bgmTrackUserPicked || directive.AnchorBgmMood.Length == 0) return false;
        if (!Enum.TryParse<PromptFlowStudio.Services.Export.BabyBgmTrack>(directive.AnchorBgmMood, true, out var track) || !Enum.IsDefined(track)) return false;
        if (track == _bgmTrack && _bgmOn) return false;
        _bgmTrack = track;
        _bgmOn = true;
        return true;
    }

    /// <summary>💬 불러온 시리즈 편과 사진 목록이 같으면 3막 자막에 "n/N편" 접두 · 계속/완결 접미(중복 장식 방지).</summary>
    private void ApplySeriesCueDecoration()
    {
        if (_series is null || _seriesActiveEpisode <= 0 || _montageCues is not { Count: > 0 } cues
            || !string.Equals(_seriesEpisodeKey, string.Join("|", _montagePhotos), StringComparison.Ordinal)) { _seriesCueState = null; _seriesComposedCues = null; return; }
        if (_seriesCueState is not null && ReferenceEquals(cues, _seriesComposedCues)) { RecomposeSeriesCues(); return; }   // 이미 합성된 자막 — 이중 장식 방지
        // 새 원문(템플릿 · AI 생성 · A/B 변형) → 레이어 상태 재시작 · 📺 편 간 이탈 덧입힘(훅 · 클리프행어)은 원문과 분리 보관 —
        //    [추천만 표시] 모드는 원문 그대로(추천 문구는 시리즈 패널 배지로만 노출)
        _seriesCueState = PromptFlowStudio.Services.Pluto.PlutoSubtitleOverlayState.FromBase(cues);
        RecomposeSeriesCues();
    }

    /// <summary>🎞️ [전편 순차 출력] — 1편부터 불러오기 → 15초 몽타주 렌더(편별 실패 → 다음 편 계속 · [부분 구제]).</summary>
    private async Task ExportSeriesSequentiallyAsync()
    {
        if (_series is not { } s || _montageBusy || _motionBusy || _stockBusy || _seriesBusy) return;
        var done = new List<string>(s.Episodes.Count);
        foreach (var ep in s.Episodes)
        {
            if (_disposed || _mediaCts.IsCancellationRequested) return;
            await LoadSeriesEpisodeAsync(ep);
            if (_disposed || _activeMontagePlan is null) continue;
            await RenderMontageVideoAsync();
            if (_montageOutput is { } outPath) done.Add(Path.GetFileName(outPath));
        }
        if (_disposed) return;
        _seriesToast = "🎞️ 시리즈 출력 " + done.Count.ToString(CultureInfo.InvariantCulture) + "/" + s.Episodes.Count.ToString(CultureInfo.InvariantCulture) + "편" + (done.Count > 0 ? " · " + string.Join(" · ", done) : "");
        await InvokeAsync(StateHasChanged);
    }

    // ── 🎬 Pluto 4.5 — 시리즈 전편 연속 렌더링 + 일괄 내보내기 ──
    private bool _seriesRenderAllBusy;

    /// <summary>🎬 원클릭 — 편별 불러오기(잠금 몽타주 플랜 · 3막 자막 · 현행 BGM/룩) → 렌더 → 진행 표시 → 렌더 1편 이상이면 즉시 일괄 내보내기(예외 전파 금지 · [부분 구제]).</summary>
    private async Task RenderAndExportSeriesAsync()
    {
        if (_series is not { } s || _seriesRenderAllBusy || _montageBusy || _motionBusy || _stockBusy || _seriesBusy || _seriesExportBusy) return;
        _seriesRenderAllBusy = true;
        var rendered = 0;
        var total = s.Episodes.Count.ToString(CultureInfo.InvariantCulture);
        try
        {
            for (var i = 0; i < s.Episodes.Count; i++)
            {
                if (_disposed || _mediaCts.IsCancellationRequested || !ReferenceEquals(_series, s)) return;
                var ep = s.Episodes[i];
                await LoadSeriesEpisodeAsync(ep);
                if (_disposed) return;
                _seriesToast = "🎬 시리즈 연속 렌더링 중 (" + (i + 1).ToString(CultureInfo.InvariantCulture) + "/" + total + "편)...";
                await InvokeAsync(StateHasChanged);
                if (_activeMontagePlan is null) continue;
                _seriesEpisodeOutputs.TryGetValue(ep.EpisodeNumber, out var before);
                await RenderMontageVideoAsync();
                if (_seriesEpisodeOutputs.TryGetValue(ep.EpisodeNumber, out var after) && !string.Equals(before, after, StringComparison.Ordinal)) rendered++;
            }
        }
        catch (OperationCanceledException) { return; }   // 페이지 이탈
        catch (Exception ex) { Program.Log("Workspace.SeriesRenderAll", ex); _seriesToast = "⚠ 시리즈 연속 렌더링 실패: " + PromptFlowStudio.Services.Pluto.PlutoAutonomousActivityFeedService.Redact(ex.Message); }
        finally { _seriesRenderAllBusy = false; }
        if (_disposed) return;
        if (_seriesEpisodeOutputs.Count == 0)
        {
            if (_seriesToast is null || _seriesToast.StartsWith("🎬", StringComparison.Ordinal)) _seriesToast = "⚠ 렌더된 편이 없어 내보내기를 건너뜁니다.";
            await InvokeAsync(StateHasChanged);
            return;
        }
        await ExportSeriesBatchAsync();
        if (!_disposed && _seriesToast is { } t) { _seriesToast = "🎬 " + rendered.ToString(CultureInfo.InvariantCulture) + "/" + total + "편 렌더 · " + t; await InvokeAsync(StateHasChanged); }
    }

    // ── 📦 Pluto 4.4.1 — 시리즈 일괄 내보내기 ──
    private readonly Dictionary<int, string> _seriesEpisodeOutputs = new();
    private bool _seriesExportBusy;

    /// <summary>불러온 시리즈 편과 같은 사진 목록으로 렌더된 몽타주 → 편 번호별 산출물 기록.</summary>
    private void RecordSeriesEpisodeOutput(string rendered)
    {
        if (_series is null || _seriesActiveEpisode <= 0) return;
        if (!string.Equals(_seriesEpisodeKey, string.Join("|", _montagePhotos), StringComparison.Ordinal)) return;
        _seriesEpisodeOutputs[_seriesActiveEpisode] = rendered;
    }

    /// <summary>📦 [시리즈 전체 일괄 내보내기] — 렌더된 편 영상 → StockSuite 시리즈 폴더 EpNN + series_manifest.json(예외 전파 금지).</summary>
    private async Task ExportSeriesBatchAsync()
    {
        if (_series is not { } s || _seriesExportBusy || _montageBusy || _seriesBusy) return;
        var root = StockSuite.ConfiguredDirectory;
        if (string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(root)) { _seriesToast = "⚠ StockSuite 에셋 경로가 설정되지 않았습니다 — 환경설정에서 경로를 지정하세요."; return; }
        var paths = new string[s.Episodes.Count];
        for (var i = 0; i < paths.Length; i++) paths[i] = _seriesEpisodeOutputs.TryGetValue(s.Episodes[i].EpisodeNumber, out var p) ? p : "";
        _seriesExportBusy = true;
        StateHasChanged();
        try
        {
            var r = await StockSuite.ExportSeriesBatchToStockSuiteAsync(root, s, paths, _mediaCts.Token);
            _seriesToast = (r.Ok ? "✅ " : "⚠ ") + r.Message;
        }
        catch (OperationCanceledException) { return; }   // 페이지 이탈
        catch (Exception ex) { Program.Log("Workspace.SeriesBatchExport", ex); _seriesToast = "⚠ 시리즈 일괄 내보내기 실패: " + PromptFlowStudio.Services.Pluto.PlutoAutonomousActivityFeedService.Redact(ex.Message); }
        finally { _seriesExportBusy = false; }
        if (_disposed) return;
        await InvokeAsync(StateHasChanged);
    }

    // ── 🔭 Pluto 4.3 — 자율 트렌드 기획안 ──
    private IReadOnlyList<PromptFlowStudio.Services.Pluto.PlutoTrendOpportunityBrief>? _briefs;
    private bool _briefsBusy;
    private string? _briefsToast;

    /// <summary>🔭 [기획안 새로고침] — 3선 생성(4단 페일오버 · 예외 전파 금지).</summary>
    private async Task RefreshBriefsAsync()
    {
        if (_briefsBusy) return;
        if (EcoSp.GetService(typeof(PromptFlowStudio.Services.Pluto.IPlutoTrendOpportunityEngine)) is not PromptFlowStudio.Services.Pluto.IPlutoTrendOpportunityEngine engine) { _briefsToast = "⚠ 트렌드 기획 엔진을 사용할 수 없습니다."; return; }
        _briefsBusy = true;
        _briefsToast = null;
        StateHasChanged();
        try
        {
            _briefs = await engine.GenerateDailyBriefsAsync(3, _mediaCts.Token);
            if (_briefs.Count == 0) _briefsToast = "⚠ 오늘은 오답 노트를 피한 기획안을 찾지 못했습니다.";
        }
        catch (OperationCanceledException) { return; }   // 페이지 이탈
        catch (Exception ex) { Program.Log("Workspace.Briefs", ex); _briefsToast = "⚠ 기획안 생성 실패: " + PromptFlowStudio.Services.Pluto.PlutoAutonomousActivityFeedService.Redact(ex.Message); }
        finally { _briefsBusy = false; }
        if (_disposed) return;
        await InvokeAsync(StateHasChanged);
    }

    /// <summary>🚀 [이 기획안으로 즉시 세팅] — 프롬프트 · 룩 고정 · BGM 트랙 · 학습 추천 갱신 · 몽타주 재구성(있을 때) 원클릭.</summary>
    private async Task ApplyBriefAsync(PromptFlowStudio.Services.Pluto.PlutoTrendOpportunityBrief brief)
    {
        if (brief is null || _briefsBusy || _montageBusy || State.IsBusy) return;
        try
        {
            Snap("기획안 적용 전");
            _prompt = brief.ReadyPrompt;
